<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'PingFang SC' }}>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 64, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 21, fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>知迹 · 答辩汇报</Text>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 1010, top: 21, width: 194, textAlign: 'right', fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF' }}>赛道十三 · 智慧教育</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 92, width: 1128 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 33, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>聊再久也不忘事，也不把整段记录都塞进去</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>第三个时刻：聊到第二十轮，它还记不记得最开始说过什么</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 190, width: 560, height: 360, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>打个比方 · 新人接手一个项目</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 116, borderLeft: '3px solid #D9534F', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F', marginTop: 10 }}>把三小时录音丢给他</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>
          他得从头听到尾，重点埋在中间，还特别慢。这就是把全部聊天记录塞给模型的后果。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 116, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 10 }}>给一页纪要</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>
          谁、做了什么、卡在哪、下一步——三十秒就能接上。知迹留下的就是这一页。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 96, borderLeft: '3px solid #3D7BD9', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 10 }}>所以它不会「越聊越糊涂」</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>
          前面聊过什么、结论是什么，都留在纪要里，后面接着用。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 700, top: 190, width: 504, height: 360, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>这一页纪要长什么样</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', marginTop: 16 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 64, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>240</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', paddingBottom: 8, paddingLeft: 8 }}>字以内</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>
      超过就不叫纪要了，反而占地方。所以有硬上限。
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 22, gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 18 }}>·</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6, width: 460 }}>最近问过的 3 个问题（知道你在关心什么）</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 18 }}>·</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6, width: 460 }}>上一轮得出的结论（避免自相矛盾）</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 18 }}>·</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6, width: 460 }}>一条预算线：当天用量超了就停，不乱花钱</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 700, top: 446, width: 504, height: 114, borderTop: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'column', paddingTop: 12 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>为什么不用模型来写这份纪要</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>
      模型的摘要每次都不一样，测试就没法比对。用「抽取」的办法，同一段对话永远得到同一份纪要，
      才能判断「这次改动有没有让它变差」。
    </Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 580, width: 1128, height: 50, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>
      工程上叫：抽取式摘要（不额外调模型、结果可复现）+ 用量预算
    </Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, bottom: 24, width: 1128, height: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>知迹 · 基于大模型智能体的 AI 教育学习系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>05 / 10</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
